<details class="admin-fold"><summary>全體玩家發放寵物 <span class="mini">將指定寵物發給每位玩家</span></summary><div class="admin-fold-body"><div class="card"><label for="adminAllPetId">寵物種類</label><select id="adminAllPetId" class="field" style="width:100%;margin:7px 0 12px"></select><label for="adminAllPetAmount">每位玩家發放數量</label><input id="adminAllPetAmount" type="number" min="1" max="1000" value="1" class="field" style="width:100%;margin:7px 0 12px"><button class="primary" id="adminAllPetGrantBtn" style="width:100%">發放給全體玩家</button><p class="mini">執行前會再次確認；寵物會保存至玩家雲端存檔。</p><p id="adminAllPetMessage" class="muted" role="status"></p></div></div></details>
